# the Throne Room's Where Two Paths Converge (battlefield 161, Bastok 9-2's), area 2 (option 18): the same fight on
# that area's Zeid (+4); Zeid (unkillable) takes the hits to 1 HP; his COMBAT_TICK listener (armed by the group's
# setup) below 70% HP sets ChangingPhase and plays 32004 (3, 3, 1, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3) to every player, despawning him;
# 32004's finish spawns Zeid_2 at his HP share, Volker, and sets the char down; Zeid_2's death: WON, 32001 opens in the
# kill step; its finish is the mission's (status 2).
char zone=ThroneRoom pos=-108,-6,0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
